{
  "name": "Corporate",
  "id": "corporate",
  "version": "2.3.4",
  "description": "Professional blue/gray theme for business applications",
  "content": "## Corporate\n\nA clean, professional theme built for business applications. Cool blue accents on neutral gray backgrounds keep the interface focused and distraction-free.\n\n### Highlights\n\n- **Light-first design** with a polished, enterprise-ready look\n- **Sky blue accent (#0ea5e9)** for links, buttons, and active states\n- **System fonts** — no custom font download required\n- Dark mode included for low-light conditions\n\n### Usage\n\n```html\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/corporate.css\">\n```\n\nDefaults to light mode. Switch with `pa-mode-light` / `pa-mode-dark` on `<body>`. Auto-switching via `prefers-color-scheme` is enabled by default.",
  "author": "KeenMate",
  "license": "MIT",
  "modeCssClass": "pa-mode-{mode}",
  "variantCssClass": "pa-color-{variant}",
  "colorVariants": [
    {
      "id": "",
      "name": "Default",
      "file": "dist/corporate.css",
      "modes": [
        {
          "id": "light",
          "name": "Light",
          "default": true,
          "colors": {
            "accent": "#0ea5e9",
            "background": "#f4f6f9",
            "surface": "#ffffff",
            "text": "#334155",
            "header": "#1e293b",
            "sidebar": "#f8fafc"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dark",
          "name": "Dark",
          "colors": {
            "accent": "#0ea5e9",
            "background": "#0f172a",
            "surface": "#1e293b",
            "text": "#f1f5f9",
            "header": "#0f172a",
            "sidebar": "#1e293b"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "features": {
    "cssVariables": true,
    "responsiveLayout": true,
    "compactMode": true,
    "sidebarCollapse": true,
    "sidebarIconMode": true,
    "customFonts": false,
    "rtlSupport": false,
    "printStyles": false
  },
  "exports": {
    "css": "./dist/corporate.css",
    "scss": "./src/scss/corporate.scss"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "core": "^2.3.4"
  },
